    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the virtual space &quot;Void Path&quot;. This is a virtual space set in a residential area in Japan, and there is no one there except you. Your goal is to reach the exit of this space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/343c98159cec0330558794ada8ebf47c.poster.avif?t=1730257294\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/343c98159cec0330558794ada8ebf47c.webm?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/343c98159cec0330558794ada8ebf47c.mp4?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this space, you are the size of a child and only 140 cm tall, but don't worry. No grotesque monsters will chase you or suddenly appear in front of you to attack you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/4313be9a1d0e63811a30af85f75a0e2a.poster.avif?t=1730257294\" width=612 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/4313be9a1d0e63811a30af85f75a0e2a.webm?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/4313be9a1d0e63811a30af85f75a0e2a.mp4?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be a little bit of horror, but it's nothing serious. You'll easily reach the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/46135f002fe92c1f89ae905c3ba3cf02.poster.avif?t=1730257294\" width=624 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/46135f002fe92c1f89ae905c3ba3cf02.webm?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/46135f002fe92c1f89ae905c3ba3cf02.mp4?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual space is an unstable place. Never deviate from the regular route, as the system may collapse. Interacting suspicious objects is out of the question. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all for now. Enjoy your &quot;Void Path&quot;!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the virtual space &quot;Void Path&quot;. This is a virtual space set in a residential area in Japan, and there is no one there except you. Your goal is to reach the exit of this space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/343c98159cec0330558794ada8ebf47c.poster.avif?t=1730257294\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/343c98159cec0330558794ada8ebf47c.webm?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/343c98159cec0330558794ada8ebf47c.mp4?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this space, you are the size of a child and only 140 cm tall, but don't worry. No grotesque monsters will chase you or suddenly appear in front of you to attack you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/4313be9a1d0e63811a30af85f75a0e2a.poster.avif?t=1730257294\" width=612 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/4313be9a1d0e63811a30af85f75a0e2a.webm?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/4313be9a1d0e63811a30af85f75a0e2a.mp4?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be a little bit of horror, but it's nothing serious. You'll easily reach the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/46135f002fe92c1f89ae905c3ba3cf02.poster.avif?t=1730257294\" width=624 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/46135f002fe92c1f89ae905c3ba3cf02.webm?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039060/extras/46135f002fe92c1f89ae905c3ba3cf02.mp4?t=1730257294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual space is an unstable place. Never deviate from the regular route, as the system may collapse. Interacting suspicious objects is out of the question. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all for now. Enjoy your &quot;Void Path&quot;!</p>",
